{#- The Lite rolling summary (FR-LITE-2; #72): one template, two modes.

``compress`` folds one chunk of the story's own transcript rows (whole turns) into a segment;
``merge`` folds adjacent segments, oldest first, into one coarser segment. The segment just
before is context only, never restated. The model is asked for third person, past tense, about
``target_tokens`` tokens, keeping names and commitments. -#}
{% block system %}
You keep the running memory of an interactive story. Write a summary in the third person and the past tense, about {{ target_tokens }} tokens long. Keep every character's name, what each one did and learned, promises and commitments made, and anything left unresolved. Add nothing that is not in the text. Write prose only: no headings, lists or commentary.
{% if character_names %}
Characters: {{ character_names | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if prior_segments %}

## Earlier in the story (context only, do not repeat)
{% for segment in prior_segments %}
{{ segment }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
{% block user %}
{% if mode == "merge" %}
Combine these consecutive summaries{% if covers %} of turns {{ covers }}{% endif %} into one shorter summary:

{% for segment in merge_segments %}
{{ segment }}

{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Summarise these messages{% if covers %} from turns {{ covers }}{% endif %}:

{% for line in messages %}
{% if line.text %}{{ line.name }}: {{ line.text }}{% else %}{{ line.name }}:{% if line.say %} "{{ line.say }}"{% endif %}{% if line.do %} *{{ line.do }}*{% endif %}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
